{"diagnosis": "Loopback send 0xa5 returned 0xff with tohost FAIL 0xdead because recv_buf_valid never set so reg_dat_do stayed ~0. ser_tx equals send_pattern[0] and reset send_pattern <= ~1 at line 114 forces idle low instead of high so no start-bit is seen. The wrong idle constant stalls the send_dummy/send_bitcnt sequencer from emitting a valid frame, leaving the receiver waiting to 2024 cycles.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picosoc/simpleuart.v b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
--- a/picosoc/simpleuart.v
+++ b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
@@ -113,5 +113,5 @@
 		if (!resetn) begin
-			send_pattern <= ~1;
+			send_pattern <= ~0;
 			send_bitcnt <= 0;
 			send_divcnt <= 0;
 			send_dummy <= 1;
", "expected": "tohost PASS, uart loopback got 0xa5 want 0xa5 TRAP gone"}

